sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Filter as Filter (JwtAuthFilter)
    participant Svc as Service
    Client->>Filter: GET /api/v1/resource (Headers: Authorization: Bearer <AT_Tampered>)
    Filter->>Svc: jwtGenerator.isValidToken(AT_Tampered)
    Svc->>Svc: validateToken(AT_Tampered) (Xác thực signature bằng Secret Key)
    Note over Svc: Chữ ký không khớp hoặc định dạng token không hợp lệ
    Svc-->>Filter: return false (Không gọi Database)
    Filter-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized